---
const facets = [
  "Implementation leadership",
  "Forward-deployed engineering",
  "Management consulting",
  "Workflow automation",
  "Adoption",
];
---

<section id="top" class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 pt-20 pb-24 md:pt-28 md:pb-32">
  <p class="eyebrow text-espresso reveal">
    AI Solutions — from problem to adoption
  </p>

  <h1
    class="reveal mt-7 max-w-4xl text-forest"
    style="font-size: var(--text-display)"
  >
    I turn operational problems into AI-enabled workflows that change how work
    gets done.
  </h1>

  <p
    class="reveal mt-8 max-w-2xl text-ink/75"
    style="font-size: var(--text-lead); transition-delay: 60ms"
  >
    I work at the intersection of business and technology — identifying where
    work breaks down, designing AI-enabled workflows to fix it, integrating the
    technical solution, and helping people actually adopt it. Not an
    introduction to AI. A change in how the work happens.
  </p>

  <div
    class="reveal mt-11 flex flex-wrap gap-4"
    style="transition-delay: 120ms"
  >
    <a href="#projects" class="btn btn-primary">View selected projects</a>
    <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-secondary">Get in touch</a>
  </div>

  <ul
    class="reveal mt-16 flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-3 border-t border-espresso/20 pt-6 text-sm text-ink/55"
    style="transition-delay: 160ms"
  >
    {
      facets.map((facet) => (
        <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-burnt" aria-hidden="true" />
          {facet}
        </li>
      ))
    }
  </ul>
</section>
